{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow a brief glimpse into the story of a romantic drama inspired by the fairy tale of Little Red Riding Hood, about a lonely and traumatized boy named Tsuki Ito. Throughout his school life, no classmate has ever mattered to him, and this is no different at his new school. Unsure of how to get home after his first day of school, he decides to spend the night at the school, where his fate will be determined.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781310/extras/In_Oka.png?t=1755501801\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781310/extras/In_Tsuki.png?t=1755501801\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demo Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running time: 15 to 20 minutes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dramatic, disturbing, and bloody story. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The narrative branches out based on your choices. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo features two endings.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A drama/horror experience inspired by &quot;Little Red Riding Hood&quot;</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3781310?t=1755501801","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3781310?t=1755501801","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781310/e82457018878628b0d977780a6b3be9343c5077e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755501801","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781310/e82457018878628b0d977780a6b3be9343c5077e/c